      "role": "user",
      "content": "Please stop with the dwarves, elves, and dragons. I am trying to study for a professional certification, not a storybook. \n\nCan you redo that explanation using strictly engineering and thermodynamic terms? Specifically, please explain the temperature rise in terms of the adiabatic process and how that affects the mass flow rate and volumetric efficiency of the engine.",
      "source": "evaluator"
